{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your dream space amidst soothing Lofi melodies and embark on a journey of focused productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lofi Haven</strong> is an innovative fusion of <strong>a gamified focus tool</strong> and <strong>an immersive room decoration simulator</strong>. More than just a background music app, it's a virtual sanctuary you can build and fully customize. Arrange your room, interact with pets, and complete goals\u2014transforming mundane work or study sessions into rewarding, therapeutic gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Deeply Customizable Room Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy highly customizable room decoration to create your own unique space. Choose from a vast collection of items, mix and match, and modify colors and materials to suit your personal style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/1ee751086026b39e5783cadab096a8ba.poster.avif?t=1770238752\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/1ee751086026b39e5783cadab096a8ba.webm?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/1ee751086026b39e5783cadab096a8ba.mp4?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Gamified Focus Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We offer an extensive library of Lofi music and ambient sounds as the perfect backdrop for your focus sessions, helping you enter a flow state quickly. Handy tools like to-do lists and Pomodoro timers provide solid support for your work and study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Adorable Pet Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let cute virtual pets keep you company through every work and study session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/aec62699516f73f0f010f09c58255ad4.poster.avif?t=1770238752\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/aec62699516f73f0f010f09c58255ad4.webm?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/aec62699516f73f0f010f09c58255ad4.mp4?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather &amp; Atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A diverse dynamic weather system\u2014from bright sunshine to gentle rain\u2014provides an ever-changing immersive atmosphere for your workspace, matching every mood and focus scenario.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/0d5bc628c6ebf7021a67846467a22ecd.poster.avif?t=1770238752\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/0d5bc628c6ebf7021a67846467a22ecd.webm?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/0d5bc628c6ebf7021a67846467a22ecd.mp4?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Immersive Wallpaper Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Activate wallpaper mode with one click to turn your carefully crafted cozy room into a live desktop wallpaper, extending the healing atmosphere to your real screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/05ead24318e0a63343c57f2f9e8499e6.poster.avif?t=1770238752\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/05ead24318e0a63343c57f2f9e8499e6.webm?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/05ead24318e0a63343c57f2f9e8499e6.mp4?t=1770238752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>An Ever-Evolving Cozy Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're committed to expanding this tranquil universe through continuous updates:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More themed furniture, decorations, and characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More varieties of adorable pet companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep integration of weather, sound effects, and game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich social and multiplayer features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curated Lofi music and various ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do list and Pomodoro timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of furniture, items, and materials to build your personal space\u2014everything is customizable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and lively cats (though occasionally a bit quirky \ud83e\udd2d)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3003690?t=1770238752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/c1bad83149b29d429809a4a4981eef6f0a85d772/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770238752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/899e7f5ef871e6ef1065b3908ef88fddba9f3bee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770238752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/899e7f5ef871e6ef1065b3908ef88fddba9f3bee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770238752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3175680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft your dream space amidst soothing Lofi melodies and embark on a journey of focused productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lofi Haven</strong> is an innovative fusion of <strong>a gamified focus tool</strong> and <strong>an immersive room decoration simulator</strong>. More than just a background music app, it's a virtual sanctuary you can build and fully customize. Arrange your room, interact with pets, and complete goals\u2014transforming mundane work or study sessions into rewarding, therapeutic gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Deeply Customizable Room Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy highly customizable room decoration to create your own unique space. Choose from a vast collection of items, mix and match, and modify colors and materials to suit your personal style.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/extras/1ee751086026b39e5783cadab096a8ba.poster.avif?t=177