f adorable pet companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep integration of weather, sound effects, and game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich social and multiplayer features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curated Lofi music and various ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-do list and Pomodoro timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of furniture, items, and materials to build your personal space\u2014everything is customizable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and lively cats (though occasionally a bit quirky \ud83e\udd2d)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Meow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003690/a7e5529f5fc42a5f8ce80a06b9fb588251e09b5e/header.jpg?t=1770238752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3003690/639185399/4e878277a2684a6cc4f7565f0a0798c0d5dae427/1755291687/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755329147","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3003690/639185399/4e878277a2684a6cc4f7565f0a0798c0d5dae427/1755291687/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755329147","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3003690/639185399/4e878277a2684a6cc4f7565f0a0798c0d5dae427/1755291687/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755329147","id":257183937,"name":"\u9884\u544a\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka